OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few clear
OL,6,Fintervals at first in east otherwise
OL,7,Fmostly cloudy with frequent showers,
OL,8,Fheavy at times with the chance of
OL,9,Fthunder. Strong westerly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FSaturday will be another day
OL,12,Fof frequent showers, heavy at times,
OL,13,Fand some sunny intervals. A windy day
OL,14,Fwith west to northwesterly gales at
OL,15,Ffirst over Isles and western coasts.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,19,FCloudier Monday with patchy rain.
OL,20,FEarly rain clearing on Tuesday then
OL,21,Fsunshine and showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
